cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PolicySwarm: an agent-based model of AI-governance opinion dynamics"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Addala
    given-names: Krishnasai
version: 1.2.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/D0nu-t/policy-swarm"
abstract: >-
  An agent-based simulation of how a population's views on AI regulation
  respond to a policy, media and shocks, with switchable "hidden choices"
  (threshold rule, gate space, policy pull, trust anchor), a local dashboard,
  and the code, data and manuscript of the methods note in paper/methods_note.
keywords:
  - agent-based model
  - bounded confidence
  - opinion dynamics
  - AI governance
  - reproducibility
